<section class="lp-card"><h2>Categories</h2><p>Transfers and owner equity stay outside P&L. Schedule C line mappings and deduction percentages must be reviewed for the selected tax year; the report is a workpaper.</p><div class="lp-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Type</th><th>Schedule C mapping</th><th>Deductible portion</th></tr></thead><tbody><% @categories.each do |c| %><tr><td><%= c.name %></td><td><%= c.kind.humanize %></td><td><%= c.schedule_code.presence || 'Review mapping' %></td><td><%= c.deduction_bps / 100.0 %>%</td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></div><% if @can_write %><details><summary>Add category</summary><%= form_with url: dashboard_accounting_categories_path(employer_id: @employer.id,book_id: @book.id),scope: :category,class: 'lp-form' do |f| %><label>Name<%= f.text_field :name,required: true %></label><div class="lp-grid"><label>Type<%= f.select :kind,%w[income expense transfer equity].map { |v| [v.humanize,v] } %></label><label>Schedule C line · optional<%= f.text_field :schedule_code,placeholder: '27b' %></label><label>Deductible portion (%)<%= f.number_field :deduction_percent,min: 0,max: 100,step: '0.01',value: 100,required: true %></label></div><%= f.submit 'Add category',class: 'lp-button' %><% end %></details><% end %></section><section class="lp-card"><h2>Keyword rules</h2><p>Case-insensitive text matching. Lower priority values run first; no executable patterns.</p><% @rules.each do |rule| %><p><strong><%= rule.data['keyword'] %></strong> → <%= rule.category.name %> · priority <%= rule.priority %></p><% end %><% if @can_write %><%= form_with url: dashboard_accounting_rules_path(employer_id: @employer.id,book_id: @book.id),scope: :rule,class: 'lp-form' do |f| %><label>Keyword<%= f.text_field :keyword,required: true,maxlength: 200 %></label><div class="lp-grid"><label>Category<%= f.select :category_id,@categories.map { |c| [c.name,c.id] },{},required: true %></label><label>Priority<%= f.number_field :priority,value: 100,min: 0,required: true %></label></div><%= f.submit 'Save keyword rule',class: 'lp-button' %><% end %><% end %></section>
